        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 0,
        "sourceEnd": 338,
        "text": "Last weekend, Li Wei went to Hangzhou with his friend Anna. Hangzhou is a famous city in China, and many people visit it every year. They took the train on Friday evening. The trip was about two hours. They arrived at 8 pm and checked into a small hotel near West Lake. West Lake is very beautiful, and it is a popular place for visitors.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ea5f9004fcc0e585a37eda080d67392e1e6ae85e81da3420b29171adbebe8cba",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 340,
        "sourceEnd": 579,
        "text": "On Saturday morning, they visited the lake. The weather was sunny and warm. They walked around the lake and took many photos. After that, they went to a tea house and tried Longjing tea. Li Wei liked it, but Anna thought it was too bitter.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0038f00d7ae73adc80c31fb0c08b3379d916792ed6c0f171fd16aa45b1ac0297",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      },
      {
        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 581,
        "sourceEnd": 789,
        "text": "In the afternoon, they rented bikes and rode to a small village. They got lost for a while, but a kind local helped them. Finally, they found the village and ate lunch there. The food was delicious and cheap.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cc4fcf42f06cad77dfbafd9eb3cdd2d58262a6f7ef4016d77f0cef022449d7d8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      },
      {
        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 791,
        "sourceEnd": 1033,
        "text": "On Sunday, they planned to visit a museum, but it rained heavily. So they stayed in the hotel and watched a movie. They left Hangzhou on Sunday evening and got home at 10 pm. Li Wei said, 'It was a great trip, but I was very tired on Monday!'",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "892541932a7c25e5d3897fadc3d0e22571be5db5b3590b300b25cc0a7fae3e8f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      }
    ]
  },
